{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114510","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114510","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1511451001:1":{"text":"ダンヌ、起きろ。","source_cn":"顿，醒醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C5A79FBE8AD9C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511451002:0":{"text":"うっ……ネフィル？俺は、なんでここに……","source_cn":"唔……那非？我怎么在这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD936C5FC08CA1080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511451003:0":{"text":"いっ……てぇ！頭がいてえ……","source_cn":"嘶……！我的头好疼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C1512120D4E8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511451004:1":{"text":"すまん、おれがやった。お前を落ち着かせるために、そうするしかなかったんだ。","source_cn":"是我打的。为了制服你，我只能这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BAB7F441D355445","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511451005:0":{"text":"はあっ？なんで俺をぶったんだよ！？","source_cn":"你！你没事干嘛打我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B20CE933E5FA2B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511451006:0":{"text":"……さっきのこと、覚えてないのか？","source_cn":"……你不记得刚才发生的事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD9BF709E91D924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511451007:0":{"text":"何をだ？おめえが俺を殴ったことか？","source_cn":"我该记得什么？你给了我几拳吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD222D935C48A95D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511451008:0":{"text":"もしかして、殴られたせいで記憶が飛んだのか？にしても、いってぇ……","source_cn":"噢，这么说来，我就是被你给打失忆了吧！嘶，真疼啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D33C76348F49E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511451009:0":{"text":"そうだ、アミーはどこだ？一緒にいたはずなんだが……","source_cn":"对了，阿米呢？我原本应该和她在一起的啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2D877E03FA4ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511451010:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1511451011:1":{"text":"ネフィルは、今さっき起きたことをダンヌに説明した。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63ACC4F3B42E80A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1511451012:1":{"text":"メヒラがルウやアミーに化けていたこと、そして……アミーが亡くなったことも。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54486652CFCFD0EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511451013:0":{"text":"<sad>アミー……そんな、どうして……？</sad>","source_cn":"<sad>阿米……为什么……为什么会这样？</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D860CAC07E217BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511451014:0":{"text":"お、俺は、アミーが偽者だって気付けなかった上に、まんまと騙されたってのか……","source_cn":"我……我非但没看破那个恶魔的伪装，还上了她的当……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CCBBBF3B96070F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511451015:0":{"text":"くそっ！あのカタストロフめ……！俺は、俺はアミーの仇すら討てなかった……！","source_cn":"我应该替阿米报仇的！是那个恶魔杀了她——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6864E3AF671629F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511451016:0":{"text":"<shk>俺のせいだ……俺が、役立たずだったせいで……！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>都是……都是我的错！是我太没用了……！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48907F0F01A4D596","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511451017:0":{"text":"……もうやめろ、ダンヌ。","source_cn":"……别伤心了，顿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75655DE3E715D137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511451018:0":{"text":"アミーと、奴に惑わされた戦士たちの仇はおれが討った。","source_cn":"我已经替阿米，还有那些受到蛊惑的战士报仇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5DFE1BFF8DD143","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511451019:0":{"text":"それでも、俺は……自分が許せねえよ……","source_cn":"我……我还是不能原谅自己……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x217312A6AD6173D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511451020:0":{"text":"……アミーのために何かしてやりたいと思うのなら、みんなで仕留めた獲物を持って、猟血祭の勝者になるんだ。","source_cn":"……如果你真想为阿米做点什么，就带着我们一起打到的猎物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC6C52D22973575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511451021:0":{"text":"数えてみたんだが、おれとお前以外の参加者は、ほとんどが獣に殺やられたか、カタストロフに唆されて殺し合って死んでいる。","source_cn":"我算过人数。除了你我，其他战士要么死在了野兽爪下，要么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE00B9BF2F55A6EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511451022:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">生き残っているのは、おれたち二人だけだ</style>。獲物を持って樹怒の谷に戻れば、アミーとテイスも一緒に勇士として称えられる。あいつらの魂は、永遠にヤクボルの月に仕えることができるんだ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>你我是唯一的幸存者<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DAD7253E2711A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1511451023:0":{"text":"……そうだな。おめえの言うとおりだ。アミーとテイスのためにも、しっかりしねえと。","source_cn":"……对，你说的对。为了阿米和泰泽，我得振作起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC381683BE88401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511451024:0":{"text":"けど、カタストロフのせいで猟血祭がめちゃくちゃになったのに……どうして、獣群の主は止めなかったんだ？","source_cn":"可是兽群之主……她为什么坐视恶魔破坏猎血节，却不加以制止？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD927567A81D0FC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1511451025:1":{"text":"……分からない。","source_cn":"……我不知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x308312031E0B19C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1511451026:0":{"text":"もしかしたら、神は祭りを見守っているのではなく、結果を待っているだけなのかもしれない……","source_cn":"或许，神并没有真正将目光投来，她只是在等待结果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D740B6786D1331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"c